Raw read quality was evaluated using FastQC. Adapter sequences and low-quality bases were removed using Trimmomatic v0.32 [34] with the following parameters: ILLUMINACLIP:TruSeq3-PE-2.fa:2:30:10, LEADING:5, TRAILING:5, SLIDINGWINDOW:4:15, and MINLEN:50. Retained reads were mapped to the A. mellifera reference genome (Amel_HAv3.1, NCBI: GCA_003254395.2) and quantified using STAR v2.7.11 [35] in paired-end mode with default parameters, except for the parameter outFilterMultimapNmax that was set to 1.
